     A            RTUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('USER')
     A            RTPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROGRAM')
     A            RTDT      R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE')
